  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Global Theming Engine: Unified M3Theme model supporting dynamic Corner Radius scaling (0.0 to 1.0) across all core components.\n- Dark Mode Strategies: Support for 'Material Dark' (#121212) and high-contrast 'AMOLED Black' (#000000) schemes.\n- Shape Tokenization: Refactored Buttons, Cards, and Navigation items to use systematic shape variables for full geometric reactivity.\n- Robust State Management: Enhanced ThemeService with safe cloning to preserve typography and shape settings during theme toggles.\n- Fix: Resolved hardcoded pixel values in core components to enable global theme builder compatibility.",
